  "notes": "From docs/packages/Package5.pdf (printed spec, no selectable text). 7x7, 5 connected symbols, max win 5,000x, bet 0.20-150.00, low volatility. Staging initialize maxWin and the Titanic Transport splash both say 5,000x (ES-008, 2026-10-15). Scatter 3/4/5/6/7 awards 10/12/15/20/30 free spins and retriggers the same way. Buy bonus purchases 10-30 spins from the scatters dealt. Enhance bet raises the feature chance. Tumbles drop winners and refill. The multiplier is a background on a winning cell, not a reel symbol: the first win marks the cell, and each later win on that same cell doubles it. A cluster pays the sum of cells already above 1. Titanic Transport base cascades (2026-10-15) matched that for every paid tumble, including doubles 1→2 and 2→4. Symbol art names are not in the spec, so catalog names stay Symbol N. Ids 8-22 are not used on the live reels. Titanic Transport is the first Package 5 title with slot controllers; the other three manifests are still scratch-only.",
